      "notes": [
        {
          "stage": "SILHOUETTE",
          "why": "layout RADIAL from the RADIAL_EMBLEM recipe orbit-rot6 (HOLDS); primitive CIRCLE from the RING member — an unfilled circle — enclosure without a corner. LINE..CUBIC are always stroked whatever stroke says.",
